		<member kind="method" name="scan">
			<signature>static func scan(root: Variant, options: Dictionary = {}) -&gt; Dictionary:</signature>
			<description>扫描一个 Variant 图并返回结构化报告。</description>
			<tags>
				<tag name="api">public</tag>
				<tag name="param">root: 扫描根对象，可为 Resource、Object、Array、Dictionary 或标量。</tag>
				<tag name="param">options: 扫描选项。</tag>
				<tag name="return">资源图报告。</tag>
				<tag name="schema">root: Variant graph root.</tag>
				<tag name="schema">options: Dictionary，可包含 max_depth、max_nodes、include_nodes、include_scalar、include_null、include_all_properties、excluded_properties。</tag>
				<tag name="schema">return: Dictionary with ok, nodes, node_count, cycle_count, truncated, depth_limit_reached, and root_type.</tag>
				<tag name="since">6.0.0</tag>
			</tags>
		</member>
